<section aria-labelledby="findings">
<h2 id="findings">Failures, Grouped by Cause</h2>


<article class="finding" id="f1">
<div class="fhead">
<span class="fid">F1</span>
<span class="label fail rule"><span class="shape"></span>Rule broken</span>
<span class="foracle">latest_correction_selected</span>
<span class="fcount">25 cases · c-0001, c-0003, c-0006, c-0009, c-0012 and 20 more · already minimal</span>
</div>
<h3>The importer kept the older reading when a correction arrived 3 days later.</h3>
<div class="fbody">
<div class="fleft">
<div class="facts">
<span class="k">Expected</span><span class="v">6.1 mmol&#x2f;L from Observation&#x2f;obs-glucose-3-corrected, issued 2026-01-13T09:12:00Z</span>
<span class="k">Got</span><span class="v">latest_glucose = 7.2 from Observation&#x2f;obs-glucose-3</span>
<span class="k">Mutation</span><span class="v"><code>observation.duplicate_with_changed_issued days_later=3 value_delta=-1.1</code></span>
<span class="k">Change</span><span class="v">Observation&#x2f;obs-glucose-3 copied as Observation&#x2f;obs-glucose-3-corrected: status corrected, issued 3 days later, value 7.2 to 6.1</span>
<span class="k">Shrunk</span><span class="v">9 entries not needed to fail were removed</span>
<span class="k">Check</span><span class="v">Built in. Reads &#x2f;latest&#x2f;synthetic-glucose from your target&#x27;s view</span>

</div>
<table class="layers">
<caption>Validation of the shrunk bundle</caption>
<tbody>
<tr><td>R4 JSON schema 4.0.1</td><td class="r">Valid</td></tr>
<tr><td>References inside the bundle</td><td class="r">All resolve</td></tr>
<tr><td>HL7 validator</td><td class="r caution">Not run, add --strict</td></tr>

</tbody>
</table>
<p class="why">This bundle is valid FHIR. A correction is legitimate, so a robust importer should prefer the later issued time or the final status.</p>
</div>
<div class="fright">

<div class="diff">
<div class="dhead"><span class="dlabel">Observation&#x2f;obs-glucose-3</span><span class="dcount">1 path changed</span></div>
