<article class="finding" id="f2">
<div class="fhead">
<span class="fid">F2</span>
<span class="label fail rule"><span class="shape"></span>Rule broken</span>
<span class="foracle">invalid_rejected</span>
<span class="fcount">13 cases · c-0002, c-0011, c-0019, c-0023, c-0033 and 8 more · already minimal</span>
</div>
<h3>The importer accepted the bundle without rejecting or flagging it when a result reference pointed at a resource that is not in the bundle.</h3>
<div class="fbody">
<div class="fleft">
<div class="facts">
<span class="k">Expected</span><span class="v">rejected, or flagged at a declared view pointer</span>
<span class="k">Got</span><span class="v">accepted (exit 0)</span>
<span class="k">Mutation</span><span class="v"><code>reference.dangling_target field=result</code></span>
<span class="k">Change</span><span class="v">DiagnosticReport&#x2f;dr-a1&#x2f;result&#x2f;2&#x2f;reference: Observation&#x2f;obs-protein-1 changed to Observation&#x2f;obs-protein-1-missing, which is not in the bundle</span>
<span class="k">Shrunk</span><span class="v">6 entries not needed to fail were removed</span>
<span class="k">Check</span><span class="v">Built in. Expects a rejected exit code, a 4xx response or a flag in the view</span>

</div>
<table class="layers">
<caption>Validation of the shrunk bundle</caption>
<tbody>
<tr><td>R4 JSON schema 4.0.1</td><td class="r">Valid</td></tr>
<tr><td>References inside the bundle</td><td class="r">1 broken</td></tr>
<tr><td>HL7 validator</td><td class="r caution">Not run, add --strict</td></tr>

</tbody>
</table>
<p class="why">This bundle is invalid. Accepting it silently stores a record that does not hold together.</p>
</div>
<div class="fright">

<div class="diff">
<div class="dhead"><span class="dlabel">DiagnosticReport&#x2f;dr-a1&#x2f;result&#x2f;2&#x2f;reference</span><span class="dcount">1 path changed</span></div>
<div class="dbody" role="group" aria-label="Diff of the shrunk bundle against the base bundle">
<div class="dl context"><span>214</span><span></span><span class="t">          },</span></div>
<div class="dl context"><span>215</span><span></span><span class="t">          {</span></div>
<div class="dl removed"><span>216</span><span>−</span><span class="t">            &quot;reference&quot;: &quot;Observation&#x2f;obs-protein-1&quot;</span></div>
<div class="dl added"><span>216</span><span>+</span><span class="t">            &quot;reference&quot;: &quot;Observation&#x2f;obs-protein-1-missing&quot;</span></div>
<div class="dl context"><span>217</span><span></span><span class="t">          }</span></div>
<div class="dl context"><span>218</span><span></span><span class="t">        ],</span></div>

</div>
</div>

<div class="replay"><span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$ </span><span class="c">recordchaos replay results&#x2f;cases&#x2f;c-0019</span></span><button type="button" data-copy="recordchaos replay results&#x2f;cases&#x2f;c-0019" hidden>Copy</button></div>
</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="finding" id="f3">
<div class="fhead">
<span class="fid">F3</span>
<span class="label fail crashed"><span class="shape"></span>Crashed</span>
<span class="foracle">no_crash</span>
<span class="fcount">24 cases · c-0004, c-0005, c-0008, c-0010, c-0018 and 19 more · already minimal</span>
</div>
<h3>The importer exited with code 101 when the Patient reference used a urn:uuid.</h3>
<div class="fbody">
<div class="fleft">
<div class="facts">
<span class="k">Expected</span><span class="v">exit 0 or a rejected exit code</span>
<span class="k">Got</span><span class="v">exit 101: thread &#x27;main&#x27; panicked at crates&#x2f;recordchaos-cli&#x2f;examples&#x2f;buggy_importer.rs:164:13:</span>
<span class="k">Mutation</span><span class="v"><code>reference.to_urn_uuid resource_type=Patient</code></span>
<span class="k">Change</span><span class="v">Patient&#x2f;pat-a: fullUrl set to urn:uuid:d1083aff-f2a0-4867-8be2-c7f38659e900, 10 references rewritten the same way</span>
<span class="k">Shrunk</span><span class="v">10 entries not needed to fail were removed</span>
<span class="k">Check</span><span class="v">Built in. Reads the exit code or HTTP status of every step</span>

</div>
<table class="layers">
<caption>Validation of the shrunk bundle</caption>
<tbody>
<tr><td>R4 JSON schema 4.0.1</td><td class="r">Valid</td></tr>
<tr><td>References inside the bundle</td><td class="r">All resolve</td></tr>
<tr><td>HL7 validator</td><td class="r caution">Not run, add --strict</td></tr>

</tbody>
</table>
<p class="why">Transaction bundles from many EHR exports use urn:uuid full URLs. The bundle is valid FHIR.</p>
</div>
<div class="fright">

<div class="diff">
<div class="dhead"><span class="dlabel">Patient&#x2f;pat-a</span><span class="dcount">11 paths changed</span></div>
<div class="dbody" role="group" aria-label="Diff of the shrunk bundle against the base bundle">
