<section aria-labelledby="notchecked">
<h2 id="notchecked">What This Run Did Not Check</h2>
<div class="notchecked">
<div><h3>Invariants and required fields</h3><p>The R4 JSON schema does not require Observation.status or check that a period starts before it ends. Only the HL7 validator does. Run with --strict to include it.</p></div>
<div><h3>Terminology</h3><p>Codes are synthetic and are never checked against a terminology server.</p></div>
<div><h3>Clinical sense</h3><p>A passing run says the importer copes with these shapes of data. It says nothing about clinical correctness.</p></div>
<div><h3>Checks that could not run</h3><p>28 oracle checks were not run on some cases, each with its reason in results.json. They are never counted as passed.</p></div>

</div>
</section>
